<title>SPAIN: POLL - Argentaria H1 net attrib. seen -13.2%.</title>
<headline>POLL - Argentaria H1 net attrib. seen -13.2%.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forecasts for first-half results for Spain's Argentaria.</p>
<p>(in billions of pesetas).</p>
<p>				   H1 97	  H1 96	 RANGE</p>
<p>    Net interest income   106.31	  97.37   104.30-108.47</p>
<p>    Operating income	 53.12	  50.51    48.30-64.76</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 32.32	  37.22    32.01-33.33</p>
<p>NOTE - The group could release results on July 28.</p>
<p>Contributors: BBV Interactivos, Benito y Monjardin, Inverban, AB Asesores, Ahorro Corp. Financiero, Beta Capital.</p>
